{"title":"The Demon King Who Lost His Job","synopsis":"Kisah perjalanan Merlin Mantan Raja iblis Kesombongan dan Alice Mantan Pahlawan manusia\nTakdir mempertemukan mereka dalam medan perang Alice yang berusaha membunuh Merlin Lucifer III bersama pasukan Vatikan telah dikalahkan\nAlice yang telah gagal dalam perang salib melawan Merlin diberhentikan sebagai Pahlawan dan berakhir dengan banyak hutang\nMerlin yang kebetulan juga diberhentikan sebagai Raja iblis berniat mengunjungi dunia manusia untuk bersantai di sana\nKeduanya berangkat bersama karena lokasi tujuan mereka sama dan awalnya mereka tidak ada niatan untuk menjalani hidup bersamasama namun takdir berkata lain mereka berdua berakhir menjadi Petualang karena tidak punya pekerjaan\nNantikan perjalanan Alice dan Merlin sebagai petualang yang menghadapi banyak bahaya","alternative_title":"Jobless Demon King","author":"SF Light Novels (SF轻小说), Ye Wu (业舞)","artist":"Tang Li Shui (汤力水)","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Demon","Drama","Fantasy","Romance","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"b62a1738-b857-4e05-a87d-f5b6436fdc7c","number":"468","title":"Chapter 468","date":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"id":"dbe6e4cb-b88b-476d-97c8-ba0e2a769c8e","number":"467","title":"Chapter 467","date":"2026-07-09","images":[]},{"id":"638128fd-b3a2-4b93-96cc-285378748e60","number":"466","title":"Chapter 466","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"563d724a-5dc2-4d3e-a6a8-8366af9e6b5a","number":"465","title":"Chapter 465","date":"2026-05-20","images":[]},{"id":"608da642-e155-4a3a-8808-4ec53f506d20","number":"464","title":"Chapter 464","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"ea7d8beb-0f60-4895-97de-eb5d0333cc85","number":"463","title":"Chapter 463","date":"2026-05-18","images":[]},{"id":"38138472-851c-4d0a-a61a-21c4c80aeabd","number":"462","title":"Chapter 462","date":"2026-05-18","images":[]},{"id":"63011c75-9dd8-42cb-8521-40708f5cef57","number":"461","title":"Chapter 461","date":"2026-04-01","images":[]},{"id":"265856e7-a8d4-4186-9